        <mxCell id="UnUAPrTQPNjwvzDrpRdy-29" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff3cc;strokeColor=#d9a339;fontColor=#5c4300;fontSize=12;spacingLeft=16;spacingTop=14;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Evaluation:&lt;/b&gt; exact output format and code retrieval&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;The answer must contain the exact target code&amp;nbsp; -&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;no substitution, no similar-looking value.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;The response must also match the required output format exactly.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;A scenario passes only if &lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;both&lt;/b&gt; code and format are correct; wrong code or wrong format = fail.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
